#message:25:10C
{
	Makes Mario berserk, increasing[BR]
	his attack power by 2.[BR]
	However, this makes him[BR]
	uncontrollable in battle.[BR]
	Action commands must still be[BR]
	done normally.[BR]
	Guarding or Superguarding can[BR]
	still be performed as well.[End]
}


#message:25:10D
{
	Lets Mario gain two more[BR]
	turns in battle![BR]
	Hustle will also overwrite all[BR]
	statuses, including positive ones.[End]
}

#message:25:10E
{
	Occasionally restores 3 HP at[BR]
	the end of Mario's turn.[End]
}

#message:25:10F
{
	During battle, saves 2 FP every[BR]
	time you attack.[End]
}

#message:25:110
{
	Lets you do a Quake Bounce.[BR]
	Uses 10 FP.[BR]
	Damages ground and ceiling[BR]
	enemies three times.[BR]
	This attack also pierces[BR]
	defence.[End]
}

#message:25:111
{
	It's a broken game console.[BR]
	Are you proud of yourself?[End]
}


#message:25:112
{
Increase jump power by 1, but[BR]
lose your hammer ability.[END]
}

#message:25:113
{
Increase hammer power by 1[BR]
but lose the ability to jump.[END]
}

#message:25:114
{
	Decreases Mario's attack power[BR]
	by 2.[BR]
	But for every hit dealt,[BR]
	Mario's HP recovers by 2.[BR]
	Mario's HP can recover by a[BR]
	maximum of 5.[End]
}

#message:25:115
{
	Lets you do a Tornado Jump.[BR]
	Uses 7 FP.[BR]
	Attack enemies with a flurry[BR]
	of tornadoes.[BR]
	Tornadoes pierce enemy defence[BR]
	and hits them from anywhere.[End]
}

#message:25:116
{
	Increases Mario's attack by 1[BR]
	but only if he's at max HP.[End]
}

#message:25:117
{
A delicious cake that will restore[BR]
18 HP and 18 FP over 3 turns.[BR]
(6 HP and 6 FP per turn.)[END]
}

#message:25:118
{
A delicious cake that will restore[BR]
24 HP and 24 FP over 3 turns.[BR]
(8 HP and 8 FP per turn.)[END]
}

#message:25:119
{
Are you believing in love yet?[BR]
Restores 4 bars of Love Piety.[END]
}

#message:25:11A
{
Doubles the rate at which[BR]
Mario recovers Love Piety.[END]
}

#message:25:11B
{
Restores 1 FP when Mario[BR]
takes damage.[END]
}

#message:25:11D
{
Lets you do a Recoil Throw.[BR]
Uses 9 FP.[BR]
Much stronger than Hammer Throw,[BR]
but you will take damage too.[BR]
Recoil damage is around[BR]
the strength of a regular Hammer.[END]
}

#message:25:11E
{
Refunds 1/3 of the cost after[BR]
using a Love Deity's ability.[End]
}

#message:25:122
{
Praying will give you +1 attack[BR]
for 3 turns.[BR]
Each Deep Prayer adds 1 turn to[BR]
the effect.[END]
}

#message:25:123
{
Praying will give you +1 defence[BR]
for 3 turns.[BR]
Each Deep Prayer adds 1 turn to[BR]
the effect.[END]
}


#message:25:124
{
Increases your attack power[BR]
by 1 at the cost of Love Piety.[BR]
Each boosted attack costs 0.375[BR]
Love Piety.[BR]
Not having enough will cause[BR]
your attack power to be reduced.[BR][END]
}

#message:25:125
{
Reduces damage by up to 1/3[BR]
at the cost of Love Piety.[BR]
Damage reduction is proportional[BR]
to the amount you have.[BR]
Amount is a number of bars[BR]
equal to 1/4 the damage reduced.[BR]
Applies after Flower Shield.[END]
}

#message:25:126
{
Reduces incoming damage by[BR]
half, but lose FP when hit.[BR]
Stacks with Last Stand,[BR]
reducing damage to 1/3.[BR]
If you don't have enough FP,[BR]
this Badge will stop working.[END]
}

#message:25:127
{
Move costs are reduced by[BR]
3 when at max FP.[BR]
With Flower Health equipped,[BR]
this takes effect at max HP.[END]
}


#message:25:128
{
	Increases Mario's attack power[BR]
	by 2 when at max FP.[BR]
	Using an FP using move at max[BR]
	FP will give you the boost.[BR]
	With Flower Health equipped,[BR]
	this takes effect at max HP.[END]
}

#message:25:129
{
A precious golden leaf. [BR]
Restores 12 FP.[BR]
This gold leaf cannot be used[BR]
to access your SD card.[End]
}

#message:25:12A
{
Pure Dayzee syrup! Restores[BR]
15 HP and 15 FP over 3 turns.[BR]
(5 HP and 5 FP per turn.)[END]
}

#message:25:12B
{
A spicy dog made by Cathy.[BR]
Replenishes 11 HP, 11 FP and...[BR]
gives Mario +2 attack for 1 turn.[END]
}

#message:25:12C
{
Stomp an invisible enemy using[BR]
the power of truth. Uses 4 FP.[BR]
Invisible enemies take extra damage.[BR]
Does [SaveColor][Color:08]magic[RestoreColor] elemental damage.[End]
}
#message:25:12D
{
Vitamins that're very good for you.[BR]
Restores 2 HP and...[BR]
raises Mario's defence by 5 for[BR]
2 turns, curing all ailments.[END]
}

#message:25:12E
{
A sweet cake to DIE for![BR]
Replenishes 38 FP but...[BR]
Reduces Mario's defence by 3[BR]
for 3 turns.[END]
}

#message:25:12F
{
A shroom hotter than magma![BR]
[BR]
Restores 15 HP and boosts Mario's[BR]
attack by 3 for 1 turn.[END]
}

#message:25:130
{
Baked bump of a Whankha,[BR]
you monster![BR]
Replenishes 16 HP and 16 FP.[BR]
Fetches for a high price.[END]
}

#message:25:131
{
Four-alarm fettuccine![BR]
Restores 15 HP, 12 FP and...[BR]
boosts Mario's attack by 2[BR]
for 1 turn.[END]
}

#message:25:132
{
A rare leaf found outside Boo's[BR]
Mansion. [BR]
Grants 1 turn of invisibility at [BR]
the cost of losing a random command.[END]
}

#message:25:133
{
Kills insects and parasites in a wink.[BR]
Works on Bzzap! and Fuzzy enemies.[END]
}

#message:25:134
{
Bower Juice! Bower Juice![BR]
Bower, Bower, Bower Juice![BR]
Gives you unlimited energy to[BR]
pick up the moon![BR]
You can beat the sun![BR]
Run a marathon in 5 seconds![BR]
AND... you can even jump over[BR]
the Empire State Building!!![BR]
[DitherFade percent=80](Lose 9 HP and 9 FP but boost[BR]
POW and DEF by 2 for 3 turns.)[/fx][END]
}

#message:25:135
{
Hanako no Tatsujin[BR]
Master of Flowers and Love.[BR]
Reduces the penalties of all[BR]
Superguards by half.[END]
}

#message:25:136
{
Let's you execute a Love Strike.[BR]
Uses 5 FP.[BR]
Strikes an enemy with the power of[BR]
love and miracles.[BR]
Attack power dealt will be more[BR]
powerful the more HP Mario has.[BR]
A successful strike also recovers[BR]
a small bit of Love Piety. [HEART][END]
}

#message:25:137
{
A rare form of bump from a Whankha.[BR]
It's quite the collector's item.[END]
}

#message:25:138
{
Programming confusion into PM64[BR]
is too much effort.[BR]
To compromise, it simply dizzies[BR]
enemies instead.[END]
}

#message:25:139
{
Lets you execute a Space Jump.[BR]
Uses 7 FP.[BR]
Brutally strikes an enemy with a[BR]
kick from space.[BR]
Does [SaveColor][Color:03]Gravity[RestoreColor] elemental damage.[BR]
Effective against airborne foes.[END]
}

#message:25:13A
{
You cannot kill me.[BR]
I am a mango.[BR]
A moist mango. Heals 9 HP.[BR]
M o i s t .[END]
}
#message:25:13B
{
Increases the amount of items[BR]
Mario can carry to 15.[BR]
This should make things a heck of[BR]
a lot easier...[END]
}

#message:25:13C
{
Eyes hurt? These will do just the[BR]
trick! Do not ingest.[BR]
